+
+## Live pre-change ratio rule
+
+Every distinct maximum-HP change now starts from the fighter's live percentage
+immediately before the change:
+
+```text
+live ratio = current HP / maximum HP
+corrected current HP = live ratio * new maximum HP
+```
+
+A prior transformation/domain lease may still retain an older percentage for
+late-write remapping, but it is never allowed to seed a later transformation,
+detransformation, Super Soul activation, or other maximum-health alteration.
+This prevents stale-ratio healing after normal damage between health changes.
+
